# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Ad Manager (GAM) — GPT tag configuration.
#
# Master switch. Leave it empty (or false) to ship the site with no ad script
# at all; every ad slot disappears and the Continue / Connect / clip buttons
# navigate straight away. Set it to `true` to turn ads on.
VITE_GAM_ENABLED=

# Ad unit paths, managed here so you can swap test for production without
# touching code. Each rotating placement accepts MULTIPLE numbered tags (_1/_2/…):
# the app serves them round-robin (request 1 → tag 1, request 2 → tag 2, …,
# wrapping after the last) so every live unit keeps getting traffic and loads
# properly. Banner is wired for up to five tags (_1–_5); interstitial and anchor
# read _1/_2. Rewarded uses a single tag. The values below are Google's
# official sample/test units, so they render without a live GAM account — put
# your real production tag paths in these same variables on the server.
#
# Top banner shown on every screen (rotates per navigation).
VITE_GAM_BANNER_AD_UNIT_1=/21775744923/example/banner
VITE_GAM_BANNER_AD_UNIT_2=/21775744923/example/adaptive-banner
# Optional extra banner tags (up to _5); blank/missing ones are ignored.
VITE_GAM_BANNER_AD_UNIT_3=
VITE_GAM_BANNER_AD_UNIT_4=
VITE_GAM_BANNER_AD_UNIT_5=
# Interstitial fired on Continue and when a clip card is tapped (rotates per refill).
VITE_GAM_INTERSTITIAL_AD_UNIT_1=/21775744923/example/interstitial
VITE_GAM_INTERSTITIAL_AD_UNIT_2=/21775744923/example/interstitial
# Rewarded ad fired on the Connect button (single tag).
VITE_GAM_REWARDED_AD_UNIT=/22639388115/rewarded_web_example
# Anchor ad pinned to the viewport (rotates per navigation).
VITE_GAM_ANCHOR_AD_UNIT_1=/21775744923/example/adaptive-banner
VITE_GAM_ANCHOR_AD_UNIT_2=/21775744923/example/banner
